// Mechanical rename *_idr → *_minor / *Idr → *Minor (docs/MULTI-COUNTRY-DESIGN.md §5.3, §6.1 WP1b).
//
//     npx tsx tools/codemods/idr-to-minor.mts            rewrite src/ and tools/ in place, list changed files
//     npx tsx tools/codemods/idr-to-minor.mts --dry      list what would change, write nothing
//     npx tsx tools/codemods/idr-to-minor.mts --sql      print migration 060's RENAME statements
//     npx tsx tools/codemods/idr-to-minor.mts --sql-down print the reverse (db/rollback/060_down.sql)
//
// Text-level and word-boundary based, longest names first, so it is idempotent:
// a second run changes nothing (every target name ends in Minor/_minor). Applies
// to .ts/.mts/.js/.html under src/ and tools/ (not this folder, not generated
// files: src/web/openapi.json and sdk/ are regenerated by `npm run openapi && npm run sdk`).
// Excluded: provider wire fields, env var names (upper case, never matched),
// config.tax.* / config.regulatory.* keys, the integration setting key
// postpayLimitIdr (stored in integration.settings; WP3), and the iOS Live
// Activity content-state keys costIdr / estimateIdr (an APNs wire contract with
// apps already installed; the Swift side changes with WP2).
